{"content":[{"c":["TYCHICUS"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["One of the believers who accompanied Paul in his trip to collect and deliver the offering for the Jerusalem church (",{"href":"?bref=Acts.20.4","r":"Acts.20.4","rawR":"Acts.20.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Acts.20.4","value":"Acts.20.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Acts 20:4"},"). Since he is often mentioned with Trophimus of Ephesus, Tychicus was likely also a native of that city. He served as the courier for Paul’s letter to Ephesus (",{"href":"?bref=Eph.6.21","r":"Eph.6.21","rawR":"Eph.6.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Eph.6.21","value":"Eph.6.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Eph 6:21"},") as well as Paul’s letters to Philemon and the Colossians (",{"href":"?bref=Col.4.7","r":"Col.4.7","rawR":"Col.4.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Col.4.7","value":"Col.4.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Col 4:7"},"). Most believe that he was also one of the two Christians (with Trophimus) who accompanied Titus in the delivery of 2 Corinthians (",{"href":"?bref=2Cor.8.16-24","r":"2Cor.8.16-24","rawR":"2Cor.8.16-24","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Cor.8.16-24","value":"2Cor.8.16-24"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Cor 8:16-24"},"). Paul mentioned Tychicus twice in his later letters, first sending him to Crete to be with Titus (",{"href":"?bref=Titus.3.12","r":"Titus.3.12","rawR":"Titus.3.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Titus.3.12","value":"Titus.3.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"Ti 3:12"},"), and later mentioning to Timothy that he had sent Tychicus to Ephesus (",{"href":"?bref=2Tim.4.12","r":"2Tim.4.12","rawR":"2Tim.4.12","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Tim.4.12","value":"2Tim.4.12"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Tm 4:12"},"). Evidently, Tychicus and Paul were close friends as well as coworkers, since Paul frequently referred to Tychicus as a “beloved brother.”"],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Tychicus","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Acts 20:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Acts.20.4","rawQueryValue":"Acts.20.4","sourceRefExact":"Acts.20.4"},{"anchorText":"Eph 6:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Eph.6.21","rawQueryValue":"Eph.6.21","sourceRefExact":"Eph.6.21"},{"anchorText":"Col 4:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Col.4.7","rawQueryValue":"Col.4.7","sourceRefExact":"Col.4.7"},{"anchorText":"2 Cor 8:16-24","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Cor.8.16-24","rawQueryValue":"2Cor.8.16-24","sourceRefExact":"2Cor.8.16-24"},{"anchorText":"Ti 3:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Titus.3.12","rawQueryValue":"Titus.3.12","sourceRefExact":"Titus.3.12"},{"anchorText":"2 Tm 4:12","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Tim.4.12","rawQueryValue":"2Tim.4.12","sourceRefExact":"2Tim.4.12"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"95ade8dc1e845c989fbd49a46ade8f81ed6cf7d637c5877e90eb036518a5ff46","sourceItemName":"Tychicus","sourceItemOrder":260,"sourceMember":"Articles/T.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Tychicus","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Tychicus","title":"Tychicus","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}